# Terraform local cache and state - never committed, may contain secrets in
# plain text (state files store resource attributes unencrypted, including
# anything marked `sensitive`). .terraform.lock.hcl is NOT ignored - it
# pins exact provider versions and should be committed, like a lockfile.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Real per-customer variables - contains real secrets. Only *.tfvars.example
# files (safe templates, no real values) are committed.
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
